    <ThingDef ParentName="LCBalShield">
        <defName>LC_Sselyg</defName>
        <label>Sselyg-31</label>
        <description>Lahlit shields are typically thick, cumbersome lumps of metal that are used more for bashing skulls in than anything else-for Consortium soldiers have no real need to prioritize form or...mobility.
Consortium close-combat armor is optimized to render most beast attacks or low-tech weapons impotent. If something can get through the armor, what's any shield of the same make going to do other than slightly delay its wielder's
gory demise? The only uses the Lahlit would have for shields are offensive ones-they are to be awkwardly held in front of their wielder's face until the enemy is in pulverizing range. They're useful for knocking weapons out of
hands...or hands off of arms.

This specific design is a much older construction-which is not out of character for the Consortium in the slightest. Whereas other megacorps re-fit the entirety of their personnel as soon as a new innovation is made to replace
the previous, the Consortium follows the philosophy of "if it works, keep using it". In its recent history, the Consortium has invented easily hundreds of thousands of different product lines and tens of millions of individual
additions to them-most of which are still in production.</description>
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Shields/Sselyg31/S31</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
            <shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
            <drawSize>0.75</drawSize>
        </graphicData>
        <costList>
            <Steel>65</Steel>
            <Orichalcum>12</Orichalcum>
        </costList>
        <statBases>
            <MaxHitPoints>320</MaxHitPoints>
            <Flammability>0.0</Flammability>
            <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.6</ArmorRating_Sharp>
            <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.3</ArmorRating_Blunt>
            <ArmorRating_Heat>0.6</ArmorRating_Heat>
            <WorkToMake>8000</WorkToMake>
            <Mass>6.5</Mass>
        </statBases>
<equippedStatOffsets>
<ShootingAccuracyPawn>-5</ShootingAccuracyPawn>
</equippedStatOffsets>
		<recipeMaker>
			<unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedMetallicTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
			<researchPrerequisite>LCTech</researchPrerequisite>
            <recipeUsers>
                <li>LahlitTable</li>
            </recipeUsers>
			<skillRequirements>
				<Crafting>5</Crafting>
			</skillRequirements>
		</recipeMaker>
        <comps>
            <li Class="VEF.Apparels.CompProperties_Shield">
                <shieldTags>
                    <li>Gearguut</li>
                </shieldTags>
                <useDeflectMetalEffect>true</useDeflectMetalEffect>
                <coveredBodyPartGroups>
                    <li>Torso</li>
                    <li>Arms</li>
                    <li>Hands</li>
                </coveredBodyPartGroups>
                <offHandGraphicData>
                    <texPath>Things/Shields/Sselyg31/S31</texPath>
                    <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
                    <shaderType>CutoutComplex</shaderType>
                    <drawSize>1.5</drawSize>
                </offHandGraphicData>
                <offHandHoldOffset>
                    <northDefault>
                        <offset>(0, 0, 0.2)</offset>
                        <behind>true</behind>
                    </northDefault>
                    <east>
                        <offset>(-0.05, 0, 0.2)</offset>
                        <behind>true</behind>
                    </east>
                    <south>
                        <offset>(0, -0.04, 0.2)</offset>
                    </south>
                    <west>
                        <offset>(0.05, 0, 0.2)</offset>
                    </west>
                </offHandHoldOffset>
            </li>
        </comps>
    </ThingDef>
	
