	    <ThingDef ParentName="LCBalShield">
        <defName>LC_Drakkyx</defName>
        <label>Drakkyx-4</label>
        <description>The use of pistols and shields in tandem by Lahlit legionaries has roots in the Wars of Synthesis-it was one of the many tactics devised by the newly-formed Khiithk Lahlit Gvoahrdrehex, or better known as the Consortium, that gave them the edge they needed to unite their world.
Three of Lahlisek's greatest merchant-kingdoms broke every oath to their inferiors that stifled them and banded together under the ultimate, absolute rule of one CEO-Threxedog "Threx" Khul, first of the Wyrmbloods. Khul's armies may as well have been destruction made manifest-an armageddon that would not be out of place in a legend.
Lahlisek was ultimately easy pickings for the Consortium-so they turned their attention to the stars.</description>
        <graphicData>
